-w-2xl mx-auto\">Mulai dari gratis selamanya, atau upgrade ke Pro untuk fitur tanpa batas. Batalkan kapan saja tanpa syarat.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 mt-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Gratis</h3><p class=\"text-slate-500 mb-6 text-sm\">Coba fitur dasar TugasMu selamanya.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8\">Rp 0<span class=\"text-base font-normal text-slate-500\">/bulan</span></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> 20x generate per hari</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Input teks s/d 2.000 karakter</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Semua mode bahasa</li></ul><button disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 cursor-not-allowed\">Daftar Gratis</button></div><div class=\"bg-sky-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-sky-500 shadow-lg relative flex flex-col transform md:-translate-y-4\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-sky-500 text-white px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Paling Populer</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Pro Pelajar</h3><p class=\"text-slate-500 mb-6 text-sm\">Untuk kamu yang ambis dan butuh bantuan penuh.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8\">Rp 19rb<span class=\"text-base font-normal text-slate-500\">/bulan</span></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Akses UNLIMITED (tanpa batas harian)</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Input teks s/d 5.000 karakter</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Hasil lebih cepat (Prioritas Server)</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Tanpa iklan (Ad-free)</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl font-semibold bg-sky-500 text-white hover:bg-sky-600 transition-colors shadow-md disabled:opacity-70 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Pilih Pro</button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\">Guru / Tutor</h3><p class=\"text-slate-500 mb-6 text-sm\">Cocok untuk guru pengajar, bimbel, dan sekolah.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8\">Rp 99rb<span class=\"text-base font-normal text-slate-500\">/bulan</span></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Semua fitur Pro Pelajar</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Fitur &quot;Kelas&quot; (Segera Hadir)</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Kelola tugas murid otomatis</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-sky-500\">✓</span> Export hasil ke PDF/Word</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl font-semibold bg-white border border-sky-500 text-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-50 transition-colors disabled:opacity-70 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Pilih Guru</button></div></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 mt-20 text-center\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Pembayaran Aman &amp; Mudah</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6\">Mendukung GoPay, OVO, Dana, ShopeePay, QRIS, Virtual Account, dan Kartu Kredit.</p><div class=\"flex justify-center items-center gap-4 flex-wrap opacity-50 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300\"><img 